  "description": [
    "The stone path widens into a wide cobblestone square atop this short bluff overlooking an expansive overgrown vineyard.  Though no longer capable of offering seating, a series of broken stone benches stand sentinel over the area.  The remnants of a once large lattice hang overhead, some portions having rotted away completely, while others still hold dried-out and long-dead grapevines."
